sequenceDiagram
    participant TranscribeSvc as Transcribe Service
    participant DiarizeSvc as Diarization Service
    participant DiarizationAPI as pyannote/Azure API
    participant DocStoreSvc as Document Store Service (MongoDB)
    participant TranscriptRepo as Transcript Repository (PostgreSQL stub)
    participant EnrichSvc as Enrichment Service

    Note over TranscribeSvc: After initial transcript<br/>is generated

    TranscribeSvc->>DiarizeSvc: Analyze speakers<br/>{audioFile, transcript}

    DiarizeSvc->>DiarizationAPI: Process audio waveform
    Note over DiarizationAPI: Speaker diarization model<br/>(who spoke when)
    DiarizationAPI-->>DiarizeSvc: Timeline with speaker labels<br/>{Speaker 1: [0-10s], Speaker 2: [10-15s], ...}

    Note over DiarizeSvc: Build speakers[] array<br/>with labels, statistics, diarization data

    Note over DiarizeSvc: Update segments[] in memory<br/>Link each segment to speaker

    alt Speaker names known
        Note over DiarizeSvc: Label as "Agent", "Customer"<br/>instead of "Speaker 1", "Speaker 2"
    end

    DiarizeSvc->>DocStoreSvc: Update EnrichedTranscript<br/>{_id: transcriptId, speakers[], segments[]}
    DocStoreSvc-->>DiarizeSvc: Document updated

    DiarizeSvc->>TranscriptRepo: Update stub metadata<br/>(speakerCount, labels)

    DiarizeSvc->>EnrichSvc: Perform per-speaker analysis

    Note over EnrichSvc: Calculate:<br/>- Agent vs customer talk-time<br/>- Sentiment by speaker<br/>- Question frequency

    Note over EnrichSvc: Use for feedback:<br/>- Agent dominating conversation?<br/>- Failed to ask discovery questions?

    EnrichSvc-->>DiarizeSvc: Analysis complete

    DiarizeSvc-->>TranscribeSvc: Diarization complete